XY^2=YY'^2+XY'^2&=12^2+\left(\frac{1}{2}(5+12\sqrt{3})\right)^2\\
&=144+\frac{1}{4}(25+120\sqrt{3}+144\cdot 3) \\
&= \boxed{\frac{1033}{4}+30\sqrt{3}}. \end{align*}

